    "text": "Baton Rouge\nCalling All Tigers: Shaquille O’Neal’s Vintage LSU ID Up for Bids\nBy Evan Roberts,\n4 hours agoSports memorabilia is one of the most common hobbies among men, which is why the industry is expected to be worth over $271 billion by 2034. Shaquille O'Neal hasn't played on a professional basketball court in years, but clearly the LSU alumnus still oozes star power because why else would his 1992 school ID be available at auction for thousands of dollars?",
